      },
      "message": "feat(ui): locate-in-fixture mate tools on the Fixtures and Model pages\n\nA \"Locate part…\" verb on each Fixtures page row and a locate row on the\nModel page arm one mate draft (view state): the existing Face and Vertex\npicks land in it, part first, then the fixture face or point it sits on.\nThe form lists the mates, offers Move the part / Move the fixture, the\nX/Y/Z offset and the turn, and Apply locate (greyed with the solve's\nrefusal) queues CommandKind::Locate - one undoable command.\n\nRefs #561\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
