      "message": "fix(app): turning a part keeps a square stock square\n\nA Model-page turn (plain MoveModel) now uses the #561 square-stock rule\nthe locate already used: a box or cylinder stock square to the setup\nkeeps its orientation and is re-fitted round the turned part with the\nallowance it had on each side, quarter turns included. A move that does\nnot turn the part carries the stock rigidly exactly as before; copied or\nalready-turned stocks still follow rigidly. MoveModel::locating is now\nthe same move as MoveModel::new.\n\nFixes #571\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
