      "message": "feat(app): moving a part warns when it or its stock would sink into a fixture\n\nA plain Model-page MoveModel (move or turn) now runs the sampled\npart-and-stock-versus-fixture check locate runs (#561), factored into\nthe shared crate::fixture_clash, and carries a by-name warning (body,\nfixture, point) - a warning, never a refusal; no fixtures, no check.\nMoveFixture warns the same way against the parts and stock of its\nsetup. The status line (and MCP move_fixture) carry it as locate does.\n\nFixes #582\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
