      "message": "test(app): a turn whose regrown stock sinks into a fixture warns\n\nA yaw-90 turn of a part with a 3 mm square box stock: #571 regrows the\nblock 16 x 26 round the turned part, 2 mm into the vise jaw, while the\npart and the pre-turn 26 x 16 block stay clear. Pins MoveModel's\nmoved_stock reshape path (a local mutation reading the pre-turn mesh\nfails it).\n\nRefs #582\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
