      "message": "fix(app): a part without facets keeps earlier move warnings\n\nafter_part_move returned None when the part's facets could not be read,\ndropping warnings already gathered from earlier setups. It now skips the\npart check for that setup only, still judges the stock, and keeps\nwhat was found. The decision file also notes that the check runs on every\nMoveModel::new and could be throttled later.\n\nRefs #582\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
